s6
00:03:50.642 --> 00:03:54.442
“The more we fight against homosexual
thoughts, the more intense they become.”
— Love in Action's handbook,
rev. 1995, p. 133

s7
00:03:54.742 --> 00:03:58.542
“They can't ‘just stop’.” “…the most
difficult task of your entire life.”
— the same handbook, p. 133

s8
00:03:58.842 --> 00:04:02.642
This teaching asked people to forget their
music, their friends, their places.

s9
00:04:02.942 --> 00:04:07.242
To guard every thought that went in, keep
a journal, and report each week.

s10
00:04:07.542 --> 00:04:10.142
It made their families the cause.

s11
00:04:10.442 --> 00:04:14.242
When it did not work, it told them the
failure was theirs.

s12
00:04:14.542 --> 00:04:17.592
It was written for pastors, counselors and
lay workers.
